Z||000000||lews84||10-02-1999||05:38 PM||||I have an 84 SE. The clear coat on the wheels  had started to peal and there was bad pitting. One wheel leaked air. <P>I took all 4 wheels to Precision Wheel Service in Branford CT (1-800-FIX-BEND or 1-800-349-2363).<P>They cleaned, polished and clear coated the wheels, fixed the wheel that leaked because it was bent, and mounted and balanced new tires that I got from Tire Rack. The wheels look great. The only concern is that the clear coat may not be the tough plastic (?) the GM originally used.<P>I would recommend them for wheel restoration. ||||reg||6
